      "text": "Linux preflight classifies each path prefix with statx(AT_SYMLINK_NOFOLLOW) and reads link targets with readlink, so a symbolic link to any path inside a userspace or network mount (not only its root) is rejected from the mount table without sending that mount a request (BUG-BASELINE-009 C1; BugTriage139SixteenthLinuxTests.SqliteOpen_SafeSymlinkBelowFuseRoot_IsRejectedWithoutEnteringTheMount).",
